	<!-- Intentionally empty: used by `bin/run-device` in free mode (flag: free) so the app can be signed with a
	     free Apple ID. Universal Links, Sign in with Apple and push do NOT work in such
	     builds; everything else does. The signature expires after 7 days. -->
</dict>
</plist>
